  "title": "Madombi: Dumplings from Botswana",
  "slug": "madombi-dumplings-from-botswana",
  "summary": "Madombi are traditional Botswanan dumplings made from a simple yeast dough. They are steamed directly on top of a stew during the final stages of cooking.",
